<!-- HOW TO EXPLORE -->
<section class="container mt-4">
    <div class="card shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="h5 mb-3">How to Explore This Site?</h2>
            <p class="text-muted">
                This site demonstrates modern .NET API development by exposing resume data
                through versioned REST endpoints while also providing a simple UI for recruiters.
            </p>

            <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                <li class="mb-2">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm me-2" href="/Resume">View Resume</a>
                    <span class="text-muted">– Browse resume content through the UI</span>
                </li>
                <li class="mb-2">
                    <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm me-2" href="/swagger">Swagger API</a>
                    <span class="text-muted">– Test API endpoints directly in your browser</span>
                </li>
                <li class="mb-2">
                    <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm me-2" href="https://github.com/jasonhart-dev/ResumeApi" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
                    <span class="text-muted">– Review the full source code</span>
                </li>
                <li class="mb-2">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm me-2" href="/About">About Me</a>
                    <span class="text-muted">– A little more info about me!</span>
                </li>
                <li class="mb-2">
                    <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm me-2" href="/api/meta" target="_blank">API Meta</a>
                    <span class="text-muted">– Quick app details + links in JSON</span>
                </li>

            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

