                    <h3 class="h6 text-danger fw-semibold mb-2">Cloud & Deployment</h3>
                    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <span class="badge bg-danger">Azure App Service</span>
                        <span class="badge bg-danger">Azure DevOps</span>
